OL,3,GNEWSAV&A workers to strike over pay and
OL,4,Aconditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuseum workers at the V&A in London are
OL,7,Fto stage a two-day strike in a dispute
OL,8,Fover pay and conditions.
OL,10,FMembers of Prospect and the Public and
OL,11,FCommercial Services union (PCS) will
OL,12,Fwalk out on Friday and Saturday,
OL,13,Fmeaning only a limited number of
OL,14,Fgalleries will be open.
OL,16,FProspect is calling for a minimum 4%
OL,17,Fpay increase for staff earning above
OL,18,Fthe living wage and other benefits
OL,19,Fincluding time-and-a-half for bank
OL,20,Fholiday working.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
