OL,3,GNEWSAV&A workers to strike over pay and
OL,4,Aconditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe strike action will only cover the
OL,7,Fmuseum's site in South Kensington but
OL,8,FProspect said it remained in dispute at
OL,9,Fother V&A sites across the capital.
